OL,3,ABerlin is being blackmailed by hackers,
OL,4,Amayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FBerlin is being blackmailed by hackers
OL,7,Fwho were able to compromise city
OL,8,Fsystems and steal data earlier this
OL,9,Fmonth, its mayor has said.
OL,11,FKai Wegner said officials would not
OL,12,Fcave in to the ransom demand, which
OL,13,Fcame on Thursday evening. He did not
OL,14,Fsay how much was being sought, though
OL,15,FDer Spiegel reports the hackers are
OL,16,Fdemanding 30 bitcoin, worth around
OL,17,FbB,2m (#1.7m).
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
