OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABerlin is being blackmailed by hackers,
OL,4,Amayor says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome of the German capital's online
OL,7,Fsystems were forced to close down as a
OL,8,Fresult of the attack, while
OL,9,Finvestigators were working to
OL,10,Funderstand what data had been taken.
OL,12,FThe Rhysida group, which is thought to
OL,13,Foperate from Russia and eastern Europe,
OL,14,Fand was behind a previous attack on the
OL,15,FBritish Museum, has reportedly taken
OL,16,Fresponsibility.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
